<para>Constructs a <ref refid="class_a_g_e_1_1_sub_texture2_d" kindref="compound">SubTexture2D</ref> object from a reference to a <ref refid="class_a_g_e_1_1_texture2_d" kindref="compound">Texture2D</ref>, and two <ref refid="struct_a_g_e_1_1_vector2" kindref="compound">Vector2</ref> objects representing the minimum and maximum texture coordinates. </para>
