<para>The constructor initializes the texture member variable with the provided <ref refid="class_a_g_e_1_1_texture2_d" kindref="compound">Texture2D</ref> reference. It also calculates the texture coordinates for the sub-texture based on the Min and Max vectors. <parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
